{"format":"tvf-scene","v":1,"name":"example · three loops","loop":48,"ease":"inout","hold":0,"gravity":1,"wind":0,"trail":null,"camera":[{"t":0,"box":[-0.707727273,-0.0940909091,-0.437727273,0.118636364]},{"t":0.2,"box":[-0.707727273,-0.0940909091,-0.437727273,0.118636364]},{"t":0.23,"box":[-0.417662182,-0.0723812727,-0.0323378182,0.0560176364]},{"t":0.4,"box":[-0.417662182,-0.0723812727,-0.0323378182,0.0560176364]},{"t":0.43,"box":[0.0452801455,-0.0572175818,0.159265309,0.0408539455]},{"t":0.6,"box":[0.0452801455,-0.0572175818,0.159265309,0.0408539455]},{"t":0.63,"box":[0.27504669,-0.149547862,0.502226037,0.133184225]},{"t":0.8,"box":[0.27504669,-0.149547862,0.502226037,0.133184225]},{"t":0.83,"box":[0.265090909,-0.099,0.692181818,0.0744545455]},{"t":0.92,"box":[0.265090909,-0.099,0.692181818,0.0744545455]},{"t":0.95,"box":[0.338727273,-0.099,0.692181818,0.0744545455]}],"stops":[0.2,0.4,0.6,0.8],"beats":[{"title":"A breath on one plane","text":"On Euler's plane a [point](#lit:4) is a thing seen: its direction θ up, its distance across as ln(d/H), counted in thumbs from [one thumb](#lit:1). A read, a turn by α, slides it up. A write, a scaling of the thumb by λ, slides it across.\n\nA breath is a read and a write taken and undone: [up, across, down, back](#lit:3). It comes [home](#lit:2). Go round [the other way](#lit:5), across first, and the two reach the far corner at the same moment: the two slides commute."},{"title":"In space, too","text":"In space a read is a turn, and a write in one length scales everything by one factor, here 1.5. That factor commutes with every turn, so the breath closes there as well: [turn, grow, turn back, shrink](#lit:8,10), and the book is [home](#lit:6).\n\nLeave the write undone and [the same loop](#lit:9,11) comes home facing just as it began, only larger. A write put anywhere into a loop changes nothing but the loop's overall size."},{"title":"Two reads","text":"Join two reads instead: a turn by α about [one axis](#lit:13), β about [another](#lit:14), then each undone in turn. [The book](#lit:15,16) does not come [home](#lit:12). It is turned by Ω, with cos(Ω/2) = 1 − 2·sin²(α/2)·sin²(β/2)·sin²φ, φ the angle between the axes; about αβ·sin φ when small. At α = β = 40° and φ = 90°, [Ω = 26.87°](#lit:36), about [this axis](#lit:17).\n\nGo round again and it turns the same 26.87° again, and again: [the arrow's tip](#lit:19,20,21,22,23,24) steps round [one ring](#lit:18) and never leaves it. The leftover is the sphere of directions' own, bounded however often the loop is taken. No write is in it."},{"title":"A read and an unequal write","text":"Now let the write be a stretch: one axis scaled by c, [the other left](#lit:26), the writer's two axes drawn at V = cH. Carry [a ring the writer draws](#lit:27) through a breath, α = 40° and c = 2: [turn, stretch, turn back, shrink back](#lit:28). It comes home squeezed, 1.59 times as long and 0.63 as wide.\n\nBreathe again and again. Each breath squeezes it by about e^ζ more, with cosh ζ = 1 + 2·sin²α·sinh²(½ ln c), ζ = 0.4507: after four, [6.26 times as long and 0.16 as wide](#lit:27). Two reads leave a turn that stays bounded; an unequal write leaves a squeeze that grows."},{"title":"Steady at one length","text":"Bring c down toward 1. The squeeze a breath falls along [ζ against ln c](#lit:30), the same at c and 1/c, and [reaches nothing only at c = 1](#lit:31). There [the ring](#lit:27) comes home whole, breath after breath.\n\nA breath is steady exactly when its write is in one length: V = H, the one-length circle said of a loop. [The essay, §9](https://github.com/reportbase/wander/blob/main/papers/essays/18-read-and-write-on-one-plane.md)"}],"path":null,"items":[{"fill":{"color":"#f4f1ea","opacity":1},"stroke":null,"width":0,"open":false,"exact":{"x":[-0.9,0.9,0.9,-0.9],"y":[0.306818182,0.306818182,-0.306818182,-0.306818182],"r":null,"smooth":null,"ctrl":null,"holes":[]}},{"morph":0},{"morph":1},{"morph":2},{"morph":3},{"morph":4},{"morph":5},{"morph":6},{"morph":7},{"morph":8},{"morph":10},{"morph":9},{"morph":11},{"morph":12},{"morph":13},{"morph":14},{"morph":18},{"morph":15},{"morph":16},{"morph":17},{"morph":19},{"morph":20},{"morph":21},{"morph":22},{"morph":23},{"morph":24},{"morph":25},{"morph":26},{"morph":27},{"morph":28},{"morph":29},{"morph":30},{"morph":31},{"morph":32},{"morph":40},{"morph":41},{"morph":42},{"morph":43},{"morph":44},{"morph":45},{"morph":33},{"morph":34},{"morph":35},{"morph":36},{"morph":46},{"morph":47},{"morph":48},{"morph":49},{"morph":37},{"morph":38},{"morph":39},{"morph":50},{"morph":51}],"morphs":[{"exact":true,"open":true,"holes":null,"keys":[{"x":[-0.675,-0.675,-0.470454545,-0.470454545,-0.675],"y":[0.0859090909,-0.0613636364,-0.0613636364,0.0859090909,0.0859090909],"r":[0,0,0,0,0],"c":[null,null,null,null,null]}],"fill":null,"inPlace":true,"lag":0,"fx":null,"own":{"parent":-1,"parentAt":null,"follow":null,"look":-1,"lookRef":0,"phase":0,"rate":1,"spin":0,"motion":null,"onto":null,"laps":1,"start":null,"times":null,"clip":{"start":0.004,"len":0.986,"show":"","in":{"kind":"draw","len":0.012}},"eases":null,"straight":false,"trail":null,"cols":null,"path":null},"stroke":"#c9c2b4","width":2,"strokeOpacity":1},{"exact":true,"open":true,"holes":null,"keys":[{"x":[-0.572727273,-0.572727273],"y":[-0.0613636364,0.0859090909],"r":[0,0],"c":[null,null]}],"fill":null,"inPlace":true,"lag":0,"fx":null,"own":{"parent":-1,"parentAt":null,"follow":null,"look":-1,"lookRef":0,"phase":0,"rate":1,"spin":0,"motion":null,"onto":null,"laps":1,"start":null,"times":null,"clip":{"start":0.012,"len":0.978,"show":"","in":{"kind":"draw","len":0.01}},"eases":null,"straight":false,"trail":null,"cols":null,"path":null},"stroke":"#d4a052","width":2,"strokeOpacity":1},{"exact":true,"open":false,"holes":null,"keys":[{"x":[-0.650205,-0.658885909,-0.658885909,-0.650205],"y":[-0.037575,-0.037575,-0.0288981818,-0.0288981818],"r":[0,0,0,0],"c":[[-0.652602273,-0.0399722727,-0.656488636,-0.0399722727],[-0.6612790